@KanchimeshAPI_HostAddress = http://localhost:5185
@adminEmail = {{ADMIN_EMAIL}}
@adminPassword = {{ADMIN_PASSWORD}}
@accessToken = {{ACCESS_TOKEN}}

### Health
GET {{KanchimeshAPI_HostAddress}}/health

### Authenticated dashboard
GET {{KanchimeshAPI_HostAddress}}/api/dashboard
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Customers
GET {{KanchimeshAPI_HostAddress}}/api/customers?pageSize=20
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Login
POST {{KanchimeshAPI_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "emailOrPhone": "{{adminEmail}}",
  "password": "{{adminPassword}}"
}

###
